su text "vocabulary-review-66d4279db0878a6986b97d74" ob text "{\"reviewId\":\"vocabulary-review-66d4279db0878a6986b97d74\",\"target\":\"exponential\",\"gloss\":\"a function in which an independent variable appears as an exponent\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"gyik\",\"swos\"],\"senseId\":\"n:13811674-n\",\"targetPartOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"reviewStatus\":\"accepted-curated\",\"evidence\":\"The exponential-function sense is a mathematical object, not the arithmetic operator, so it moves to the mathematics + exponential compound. That leaves the swos atom to carry exponentiation, the operation the runtime implements, and keeps both senses addressable.\",\"coverageTarget\":\"exponential\",\"bridgeManaged\":false}" ya
